<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<sbml xmlns="http://www.sbml.org/sbml/level3/version2/core" xmlns:sbml="http://www.sbml.org/sbml/level3/version2/core" level="3" version="2">
  <notes>
    <body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
      <p>Example model of <a href="https://sbml4humans.de">SBML4Humans</a> for the objects of SBML core which carry their own attributes: a constraint with a message, an event with a trigger, a priority and a delay, a kinetic law with local parameters and a unit definition built from several units.</p>
    </body>
  </notes>
  <annotation>
    <sbml4humans:document xmlns:sbml4humans="https://sbml4humans.de/ns/example" sbml4humans:writtenBy="hand" sbml4humans:purpose="constraint, event and local parameter example"/>
  </annotation>
  <model metaid="meta_constraint_event" id="constraint_event" name="model with a constraint, an event and local parameters" substanceUnits="mmole" timeUnits="min" volumeUnits="litre" extentUnits="mmole">
    <notes>
      <body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <h1>Model with a constraint, an event and local parameters</h1>
        <p>A single Michaelis-Menten reaction converts <code>S1</code> into <code>S2</code> in the compartment <code>cell</code>. The rate law keeps its constants <code>Km</code> and <code>Vmax</code> as local parameters, so they belong to this reaction alone.</p>
        <p>A constraint states that <code>S1</code> stays below <code>S1_max</code> and carries the message which a simulator shows when it does not. The event <code>E1</code> adds a dose of <code>S1</code> five minutes after the twentieth minute and switches the reaction off; its trigger, its priority and its delay each carry their own identifier, SBO term and notes.</p>
        <h2>Terms of use</h2>
        <p>This file was written for the SBML4Humans report and is distributed under the <a href="http://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/">Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International License</a>.</p>
      </body>
    </notes>
    <annotation>
      <sbml4humans:model xmlns:sbml4humans="https://sbml4humans.de/ns/example" sbml4humans:elements="constraint event localParameter unitDefinition"/>
      <rdf:RDF xmlns:rdf="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#" xmlns:dcterms="http://purl.org/dc/terms/" xmlns:vCard="http://www.w3.org/2001/vcard-rdf/3.0#" xmlns:bqbiol="http://biomodels.net/biology-qualifiers/" xmlns:bqmodel="http://biomodels.net/model-qualifiers/">
        <rdf:Description rdf:about="#meta_constraint_event">
          <bqbiol:hasTaxon>
            <rdf:Bag>
              <rdf:li rdf:resource="https://identifiers.org/taxonomy/9606"/>
              <bqbiol:isDescribedBy>
                <rdf:Bag>
                  <rdf:li rdf:resource="https://identifiers.org/pubmed/31219795"/>
                </rdf:Bag>
              </bqbiol:isDescribedBy>
            </rdf:Bag>
          </bqbiol:hasTaxon>
          <dcterms:creator>
            <rdf:Bag>
              <rdf:li rdf:parseType="Resource">
                <vCard:N rdf:parseType="Resource">
                  <vCard:Family>König</vCard:Family>
                  <vCard:Given>Matthias</vCard:Given>
                </vCard:N>
                <vCard:EMAIL>koenigmx@hu-berlin.de</vCard:EMAIL>
                <vCard:ORG rdf:parseType="Resource">
                  <vCard:Orgname>Humboldt-University Berlin, Institute for Theoretical Biology</vCard:Orgname>
                </vCard:ORG>
              </rdf:li>
            </rdf:Bag>
          </dcterms:creator>
          <dcterms:created rdf:parseType="Resource">
            <dcterms:W3CDTF>1900-01-01T00:00:00Z</dcterms:W3CDTF>
          </dcterms:created>
          <dcterms:modified rdf:parseType="Resource">
            <dcterms:W3CDTF>1900-01-01T00:00:00Z</dcterms:W3CDTF>
          </dcterms:modified>
        </rdf:Description>
      </rdf:RDF>
    </annotation>
    <listOfUnitDefinitions>
      <unitDefinition id="min" name="min">
        <listOfUnits>
          <unit kind="second" exponent="1" scale="0" multiplier="60"/>
        </listOfUnits>
      </unitDefinition>
      <unitDefinition id="mmole" name="mmole">
        <listOfUnits>
          <unit kind="mole" exponent="1" scale="-3" multiplier="1"/>
        </listOfUnits>
      </unitDefinition>
      <unitDefinition id="mM" name="mmole/litre">
        <listOfUnits>
          <unit kind="mole" exponent="1" scale="-3" multiplier="1"/>
          <unit kind="litre" exponent="-1" scale="0" multiplier="1"/>
        </listOfUnits>
      </unitDefinition>
      <unitDefinition id="mmole_per_min_l" name="mmole/min/litre">
        <listOfUnits>
          <unit kind="mole" exponent="1" scale="-3" multiplier="1"/>
          <unit kind="second" exponent="-1" scale="0" multiplier="60"/>
          <unit kind="litre" exponent="-1" scale="0" multiplier="1"/>
        </listOfUnits>
      </unitDefinition>
    </listOfUnitDefinitions>
    <listOfCompartments>
      <compartment metaid="meta_cell" sboTerm="SBO:0000290" id="cell" name="cell" spatialDimensions="3" size="1" units="litre" constant="true"/>
    </listOfCompartments>
    <listOfSpecies>
      <species metaid="meta_S1" sboTerm="SBO:0000247" id="S1" name="substrate" compartment="cell" initialConcentration="8" substanceUnits="mmole" hasOnlySubstanceUnits="false" boundaryCondition="false" constant="false"/>
      <species metaid="meta_S2" sboTerm="SBO:0000247" id="S2" name="product" compartment="cell" initialConcentration="0" substanceUnits="mmole" hasOnlySubstanceUnits="false" boundaryCondition="false" constant="false"/>
    </listOfSpecies>
    <listOfParameters>
      <parameter id="S1_max" name="upper bound of the substrate" value="10" units="mM" constant="true"/>
      <parameter id="dose" name="dose added by the event" value="5" units="mM" constant="true"/>
      <parameter id="active" name="switch of the reaction" value="1" units="dimensionless" constant="false"/>
    </listOfParameters>
    <listOfConstraints>
      <constraint metaid="meta_constraint_S1" sboTerm="SBO:0000064">
        <notes>
          <body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
            <p>The rate law of <code>R1</code> was measured below <code>S1_max</code>, so a simulation which leaves that range is no longer a prediction of the system.</p>
          </body>
        </notes>
        <math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML">
          <apply>
            <lt/>
            <ci> S1 </ci>
            <ci> S1_max </ci>
          </apply>
        </math>
        <message>
          <p xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">The substrate <b>S1</b> left the range of the rate law of <code>R1</code>: it is above <b>S1_max</b> and the results from here on are not valid.</p>
        </message>
      </constraint>
    </listOfConstraints>
    <listOfReactions>
      <reaction metaid="meta_R1" sboTerm="SBO:0000176" id="R1" name="conversion of S1 into S2" reversible="false" compartment="cell">
        <listOfReactants>
          <speciesReference id="R1_S1" species="S1" stoichiometry="1" constant="true"/>
        </listOfReactants>
        <listOfProducts>
          <speciesReference id="R1_S2" species="S2" stoichiometry="1" constant="true"/>
        </listOfProducts>
        <kineticLaw metaid="meta_R1_kinetic_law" sboTerm="SBO:0000028">
          <math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML">
            <apply>
              <times/>
              <ci> active </ci>
              <ci> cell </ci>
              <apply>
                <divide/>
                <apply>
                  <times/>
                  <ci> Vmax </ci>
                  <ci> S1 </ci>
                </apply>
                <apply>
                  <plus/>
                  <ci> Km </ci>
                  <ci> S1 </ci>
                </apply>
              </apply>
            </apply>
          </math>
          <listOfLocalParameters>
            <localParameter sboTerm="SBO:0000186" id="Vmax" name="maximal velocity" value="1" units="mmole_per_min_l"/>
            <localParameter sboTerm="SBO:0000027" id="Km" name="Michaelis constant" value="2" units="mM"/>
          </listOfLocalParameters>
        </kineticLaw>
      </reaction>
    </listOfReactions>
    <listOfEvents>
      <event metaid="meta_E1" id="E1" name="dose of S1 which switches the reaction off" useValuesFromTriggerTime="false">
        <trigger metaid="meta_E1_trigger" sboTerm="SBO:0000064" id="E1_trigger" initialValue="false" persistent="true">
          <notes>
            <body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
              <p>The dose is given once the system has run for twenty minutes.</p>
            </body>
          </notes>
          <math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML">
            <apply>
              <geq/>
              <csymbol encoding="text" definitionURL="http://www.sbml.org/sbml/symbols/time"> time </csymbol>
              <cn sbml:units="min"> 20 </cn>
            </apply>
          </math>
        </trigger>
        <priority metaid="meta_E1_priority" sboTerm="SBO:0000064" id="E1_priority">
          <notes>
            <body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
              <p>The dose is given before any other event of the same moment.</p>
            </body>
          </notes>
          <math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML">
            <cn sbml:units="dimensionless"> 1 </cn>
          </math>
        </priority>
        <delay metaid="meta_E1_delay" sboTerm="SBO:0000064" id="E1_delay">
          <notes>
            <body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
              <p>The dose reaches the compartment five minutes after the trigger.</p>
            </body>
          </notes>
          <math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML">
            <cn sbml:units="min"> 5 </cn>
          </math>
        </delay>
        <listOfEventAssignments>
          <eventAssignment id="E1_dose" variable="S1">
            <math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML">
              <apply>
                <plus/>
                <ci> S1 </ci>
                <ci> dose </ci>
              </apply>
            </math>
          </eventAssignment>
          <eventAssignment id="E1_switch" variable="active">
            <math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML">
              <cn sbml:units="dimensionless"> 0 </cn>
            </math>
          </eventAssignment>
        </listOfEventAssignments>
      </event>
    </listOfEvents>
  </model>
</sbml>
